  <name>ScopeExclusions</name>
  <type>rundocumentation:ScopeExclusions</type>
  <baseType>core:Documentation</baseType>
  <is>Explicitly out of compiler runtime V1 library scope</is>

  <documentation>Out of scope for this library / V1:
    • CLI targets[] bootstrap order and dual CLI model
    • Writing RenderOutput files to disk
    • Incremental .bom-cache (C5) and thumbnails (C6)
    • Target-specific targetOptions schemas and emit
    • Parser/serializer/validator mapping and constraint algorithms
    • SCAD NativeBlock / engine-maker processors
    • Codegen from BML to TypeScript (structural SSOT only)</documentation>

</block>
